      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yeah, if they can bypass some of the major issues this game causes for consoles then sure this could be viable.\nConsoles aren't a fan of user generated content likely due to copyright reasons.\nThe current gen consoles (excluding PS5 and Xbox Series X) are fairly old and weak, requiring lots of optimization to ensure games run well on these. If I had to bet there would be limits for avatars / worlds (similar to the quest) and it's also likely it would be necessary to upload worlds / avatars to these specific platforms (like the quest).",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
