        "like": 1
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Given how Sony won't even allow mods for Fallout 4 and Skyrim that include external assets not found in game, I doubt they'd allow VRChat on their platform. Xbox also isn't a possibility. The hardware is weak and would probably end up with more content restrictions than the Quest. Perhaps the Xbox Series X might be able to run it, but it's possible they might be worried about the insane amount of copyrighted content floating around in VRChat. It's much more rampant in VRChat than Skyrim or Fallout 4 mods.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
